      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Step 2: The given complex number to be rotated is $3$, and the center of rotation is $-4 - 5i$. We translate the system by subtracting $-4 - 5i$ from $3$ to get the new position relative to the center of rotation. This gives us $3 - (-4 - 5i) = 7 + 5i$.",
